The device helper functions in main.cu (scan1Inclusive, scan1Exclusive,
scan4Inclusive, scan4Exclusive) and the __global__ kernel
scanExclusiveShared (bodies unmodified; only the THREADBLOCK_SIZE launch
parameter is chosen for this case's problem size) are reproduced from:

    NVIDIA/cuda-samples,
    cpp/2_Concepts_and_Techniques/scan/scan.cu
    https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuda-samples/blob/master/cpp/2_Concepts_and_Techniques/scan/scan.cu
    Copyright (c) 2022, NVIDIA CORPORATION. All rights reserved.
    SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause

