The __global__ kernel scanExclusiveShuffle in main.cu is new code
written for this repository (it does not appear in the upstream file
above; it implements the same exclusive-scan mathematics via a
warp-shuffle-based algorithm instead of the upstream's shared-memory
Hillis-Steele algorithm, so the two techniques can be isolated and
compared). All other files in this directory (Makefile,
CMakeLists.txt, reference.h, the host driver code in main.cu, and
README.md) are original to this repository and released under the
repository's main license (MIT).
